    "description": "<p>Gentle masters write their lessons in bruises, not cuts. While a character with this Charm has Crane Form active, he does not need to spend a Willpower point to channel Compassion to enhance an unarmed Martial Arts attack or parry. Moreover, whenever he does channel Compassion this way to improve an attack, he also adds the dice bonus from the channel to the attack's raw damage and he may choose to arrange inflicted bruises as calligraphy upon the victim's skin when inflicting any levels of damage.</p>",
